# Price collection on the VM: only retailers that work from this egress.
# Tesco is Akamai-blocked at the IP level here — it collects on GitHub
# Actions instead (.github/workflows/collect-tesco.yml); this crontab pulls
# that batch 40 minutes later (whole-run idempotent; needs GITHUB_TOKEN in
# the container env, actions:read PAT).
0 */4 * * * python -m beverage_feed --retailer dunnes
10 */4 * * * python -m beverage_feed --retailer supervalu
40 */4 * * * python -m beverage_feed pull-batch
